WEBVTT

00:19.000 --> 00:21.510
You continue searching to the north.

00:21.568 --> 00:22.830
Make sure to search thoroughly.

00:23.320 --> 00:23.920
- Yes!
- Yes!

00:26.112 --> 00:27.856
As for His Majesty
and the Empress Dowager,

00:27.870 --> 00:29.280
make sure they are strictly guarded.

00:29.320 --> 00:31.184
Report immediately
if there's anything unusual.

00:31.280 --> 00:31.920
- Yes!
- Yes!

00:33.790 --> 00:34.790
You guys, come with me.

00:34.790 --> 00:35.456
- Yes!
- Yes!

00:35.960 --> 00:37.470
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

00:38.030 --> 00:39.320
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

00:39.670 --> 00:43.600
Crown Prince!

00:43.600 --> 00:45.750
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

00:46.030 --> 00:52.320
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

00:52.670 --> 00:53.430
Crown Prince!

00:53.430 --> 00:57.824
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

00:57.872 --> 00:59.200
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

00:59.200 --> 01:00.880
All available men have been dispatched.

01:01.750 --> 01:03.000
The garrisoned guards nearby

01:03.280 --> 01:04.430
are also rushing here.

01:04.430 --> 01:07.060
Crown Prince!

01:07.070 --> 01:09.008
You've been keeping watch
for most of the night.

01:09.504 --> 01:10.560
The night is cold and damp.

01:11.590 --> 01:13.280
You should go back and rest for a while.

01:13.712 --> 01:15.480
The mountains here stretch on endlessly,

01:15.776 --> 01:16.960
and the terrain is complex.

01:18.560 --> 01:20.840
The enemy deliberately struck here,

01:21.430 --> 01:23.560
knowing it would be hard to search.

01:24.000 --> 01:25.510
Searching the mountain inch by inch

01:25.510 --> 01:27.200
is like looking for a needle
in a haystack.

01:27.232 --> 01:28.310
I will stay right here.

01:29.150 --> 01:30.790
Mo Yuan can report to me at any time.

01:32.070 --> 01:33.310
I want to see the Crown Prince

01:33.760 --> 01:35.120
return safely.

01:37.150 --> 01:38.680
Crown Prince!

02:58.020 --> 02:58.800
=Blossoms of Power=

02:58.800 --> 03:01.690
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

03:01.700 --> 03:04.660
=Episode 30=

03:24.768 --> 03:26.030
You're not pretending anymore?

03:26.304 --> 03:28.080
What are you talking about, Changqing?

03:28.190 --> 03:29.520
My body is weak.

03:29.520 --> 03:30.870
You can't just leave me behind.

03:50.630 --> 03:51.840
I must say, all these years,

03:52.150 --> 03:53.400
you've really put on a good act.

03:53.440 --> 03:54.280
If I didn't pretend,

03:54.352 --> 03:56.310
how could I experience
this rare brotherly bond?

03:58.080 --> 03:58.750
Don't run!

03:58.784 --> 03:59.520
Stop right there!

03:59.552 --> 04:01.120
- What happened to the brotherly bond?
- Stop!

04:01.120 --> 04:02.560
- After them!
- After them!

04:03.240 --> 04:03.870
Wait for me!

04:04.280 --> 04:05.150
Get them!

04:06.000 --> 04:06.470
Hurry!

04:07.240 --> 04:07.910
Chase them!

04:08.470 --> 04:09.120
After them!

04:10.080 --> 04:10.910
Get them!

04:15.240 --> 04:16.160
Search carefully!

04:17.750 --> 04:19.120
You guys, go that way.

04:19.360 --> 04:20.040
- Yes!
- Yes!

04:26.510 --> 04:27.680
Search thoroughly!

04:28.040 --> 04:28.870
- Yes!
- Yes!

04:34.040 --> 04:34.560
This way!

04:42.800 --> 04:43.480
Over there!

04:48.240 --> 04:48.920
Stop!

04:49.680 --> 04:50.360
After them!

04:50.430 --> 04:51.070
Stop!

04:56.680 --> 04:57.430
Don't run!

05:43.480 --> 05:44.480
They're over there!

05:45.750 --> 05:46.510
Stop!

05:49.720 --> 05:50.360
Stop!

05:51.270 --> 05:51.920
That way!

05:52.000 --> 05:52.830
Get them!

05:58.870 --> 05:59.560
After them!

05:59.560 --> 06:00.120
That way!

06:03.310 --> 06:03.830
Changqing,

06:04.360 --> 06:05.390
keep going down this path,

06:05.390 --> 06:07.050
and you'll be able
to leave this mountain.

06:07.104 --> 06:07.920
What about you?

06:08.304 --> 06:09.280
You're injured.

06:09.290 --> 06:10.590
I'll stay behind to hold them off.

06:10.600 --> 06:11.120
No.

06:11.840 --> 06:13.600
If we leave, we'll leave together.

06:14.160 --> 06:15.800
I don't want to owe you a favor.

06:16.360 --> 06:18.040
Aren't you best at saving your own skin?

06:18.080 --> 06:19.270
If you don't go back for reinforcements,

06:19.270 --> 06:20.420
neither of us will make it out.

06:20.430 --> 06:22.180
Tell Xihe not to worry
and wait for my return.

06:22.190 --> 06:22.600
Go.

06:23.360 --> 06:23.870
Come back.

06:36.870 --> 06:39.190
Crown Prince!

06:39.830 --> 06:40.680
Crown Prince!

06:40.680 --> 06:42.800
Your Highness,
we still haven't found any trace

06:42.800 --> 06:44.656
of Prince Xin and the Crown Prince
in the east.

06:44.992 --> 06:45.952
Send another squad

06:45.960 --> 06:47.190
to search deeper into the west.

06:47.190 --> 06:47.630
Yes.

06:47.760 --> 06:48.680
Somebody, come quick.

06:48.920 --> 06:50.680
Your Highnesses,

06:50.800 --> 06:52.000
Prince Xin has returned.

06:53.920 --> 06:55.480
Crown Prince!

06:57.310 --> 06:57.870
Let me.

06:59.000 --> 06:59.600
Changqing,

06:59.870 --> 07:00.920
are you badly hurt?

07:01.270 --> 07:02.240
It's nothing serious.

07:02.870 --> 07:03.950
Prince Xin,

07:03.950 --> 07:05.670
why didn't the Crown Prince return
with you?

07:05.680 --> 07:06.560
Where is he?

07:06.624 --> 07:08.576
Crown Prince and I were trapped
in a cave.

07:08.880 --> 07:11.270
We encountered a large group of pursuers
while escaping.

07:11.800 --> 07:13.040
To cover my escape,

07:13.280 --> 07:15.424
Crown Prince stayed behind alone
to hold them off.

07:15.630 --> 07:16.750
Was he injured?

07:17.680 --> 07:19.000
At least when I left,

07:19.720 --> 07:20.750
he was fine.

07:24.600 --> 07:25.560
He also said

07:27.232 --> 07:28.390
to tell you not to worry.

07:29.120 --> 07:30.270
Let's go rescue him quickly.

07:30.360 --> 07:31.160
Follow me.

07:31.830 --> 07:32.430
Mo Yuan.

07:32.720 --> 07:33.310
Changqing.

08:07.190 --> 08:08.240
Crown Prince,

08:08.830 --> 08:10.630
I finally managed to invite you here.

08:15.456 --> 08:16.920
Since my forth brother invited me,

08:17.560 --> 08:18.680
how could I not come?

08:31.270 --> 08:33.000
You knew it was me all along.

08:33.000 --> 08:34.670
The people who besieged Changqing and me

08:35.360 --> 08:36.600
were highly skilled.

08:36.600 --> 08:38.400
They were definitely
not ordinary soldiers.

08:38.448 --> 08:40.360
But they tied me up and didn't kill me.

08:43.390 --> 08:44.390
Right now,

08:44.544 --> 08:46.480
the only person who doesn't want me dead

08:46.560 --> 08:48.080
yet is my sworn enemy

08:48.240 --> 08:49.720
is none other than you.

08:49.936 --> 08:51.312
You also know

08:51.344 --> 08:52.960
that after that incident in northwest,

08:52.960 --> 08:54.120
you have no chance

08:54.120 --> 08:55.120
at the throne anymore.

08:55.440 --> 08:56.360
So I guessed

08:56.440 --> 08:58.360
that you must have
some unfinished business

08:58.384 --> 09:00.720
and wanted to clear things up
with me face to face.

09:06.120 --> 09:06.840
Huayong,

09:07.630 --> 09:09.390
I truly admire your intellect

09:10.240 --> 09:11.630
and respect your methods.

09:14.000 --> 09:14.960
Come to think of it,

09:15.840 --> 09:17.670
the biggest mistake I made

09:18.080 --> 09:19.200
was from the very beginning

09:19.440 --> 09:20.840
going against you.

09:22.080 --> 09:23.030
But don't worry,

09:24.550 --> 09:25.440
today,

09:26.320 --> 09:27.750
I'm not here to hurt you.

09:29.870 --> 09:31.030
I just want

09:32.480 --> 09:33.480
to make a deal

09:33.550 --> 09:34.790
with you.

09:35.120 --> 09:36.120
What kind of deal?

09:37.840 --> 09:39.320
Haven't you always wanted to know

09:40.080 --> 09:41.720
who poisoned you?

09:47.320 --> 09:49.120
I can tell you the truth right now.

09:51.240 --> 09:52.440
But my condition

09:53.720 --> 09:56.440
is to clear Yanyan of all her crimes,

09:56.544 --> 09:59.100
and allow her to be buried
with the honors of a Princess Consort

09:59.120 --> 10:00.272
in the imperial mausoleum,

10:00.448 --> 10:01.872
and receive ancestral offerings.

10:02.720 --> 10:03.960
As long as you agree,

10:04.200 --> 10:05.240
it can be done.

10:06.000 --> 10:07.030
Back then, Father

10:07.248 --> 10:10.000
arranged my marriage to the princess
of the fallen Nanzhou state.

10:10.360 --> 10:12.320
He used my marriage
to show his benevolence,

10:12.390 --> 10:14.840
but it also ruined my path
to becoming the Crown Prince.

10:16.000 --> 10:17.870
Later, Yanyan and I fell in love.

10:18.270 --> 10:19.200
I thought

10:19.750 --> 10:21.390
we could grow old together.

10:22.910 --> 10:24.150
I didn't expect Father

10:25.440 --> 10:26.720
to actually reprimand me,

10:26.784 --> 10:28.440
saying I was supposed to monitor her,

10:28.720 --> 10:30.270
not fall in love with her.

10:37.030 --> 10:38.150
It's truly ridiculous.

10:39.200 --> 10:40.270
My future,

10:40.790 --> 10:41.870
my feelings,

10:42.240 --> 10:43.240
to him,

10:44.360 --> 10:46.840
are nothing
but stepping stones to the throne.

10:48.150 --> 10:49.320
From childhood to adulthood,

10:50.440 --> 10:52.440
when has he ever treated me
like his own son?

10:52.600 --> 10:54.120
How could I not hate him?

10:56.960 --> 10:58.670
But Yanyan was always innocent.

11:00.840 --> 11:02.510
She was always coerced by me,

11:03.000 --> 11:04.000
taking the blame for me,

11:05.480 --> 11:07.240
and doing many things against her will.

11:10.080 --> 11:12.240
The person I've let down the most
in this life

11:13.790 --> 11:14.750
is her.

11:16.600 --> 11:18.120
Li Yanhui was deeply devoted.

11:19.030 --> 11:20.440
As for burying her

11:20.608 --> 11:21.792
in the imperial mausoleum,

11:23.200 --> 11:24.240
I can promise you.

11:30.320 --> 11:31.320
Then, thank you, Huayong,

11:32.032 --> 11:33.600
for fulfilling my long-cherished wish.

11:34.600 --> 11:36.550
But I don't need you
to negotiate terms with me.

11:38.864 --> 11:40.528
I want you to return to the palace

11:42.000 --> 11:43.480
and plead guilty to Father.

11:44.080 --> 11:45.240
Plead guilty?

11:54.870 --> 11:55.720
Huayong,

11:57.270 --> 11:58.720
do you think our father

11:58.910 --> 12:00.750
is some kind of honorable gentleman?

12:02.630 --> 12:03.670
Did you know

12:04.512 --> 12:06.630
that Prince Qian treated him
like a blood brother,

12:06.720 --> 12:08.000
yet he, on the battlefield,

12:08.150 --> 12:10.440
brutally murdered his older brother
to usurp the throne?

12:10.440 --> 12:11.240
Xiao Changtai,

12:12.200 --> 12:13.320
stop your nonsense!

12:20.150 --> 12:21.600
Actually, you and I are the same.

12:22.390 --> 12:24.120
We are just pitiful people
used by Father

12:25.000 --> 12:26.870
and then abandoned.

12:29.240 --> 12:31.550
I can tell you the truth right now.

12:31.616 --> 12:33.184
The one who poisoned you back then,

12:33.200 --> 12:34.384
leaving you bedridden

12:34.550 --> 12:36.910
and doomed to an early death,
is none other

12:37.030 --> 12:38.630
than our good father!

12:42.360 --> 12:43.270
Xiao Changtai,

12:44.910 --> 12:47.030
I've long heard

12:47.670 --> 12:48.870
these rumors you speak of.

12:49.200 --> 12:51.240
Don't seek revenge on the wrong person.

12:51.510 --> 12:53.200
But don't delude yourself into thinking

12:53.600 --> 12:55.910
you can drive a wedge
between Father and me with this.

13:06.750 --> 13:07.960
Once you see this,

13:08.480 --> 13:10.150
you'll have no choice but to believe it.

13:15.960 --> 13:18.200
(Year 8 of Youning, Daxing.)

13:18.210 --> 13:20.440
(Year 8 of Youning)
(I'm here to confess to all ancestors.)

13:20.440 --> 13:22.710
(Tablet of Prince Qian, Xiao Juewei)
(My sins burden the state,)

13:22.720 --> 13:24.790
(causing the royal family
to lose its virtue.)

13:25.030 --> 13:30.510
(Emperor Youning, Xiao Juechong, plotted
to murder his own brother, Prince Qian.)

13:31.000 --> 13:34.870
(Fearing chaos would ruin the country,
I helped him hide his crime,)

13:35.360 --> 13:37.510
(letting his sibling's blood be shed.)

13:37.664 --> 13:39.600
(Edict of Repentance)
(This is my first sin.)

13:40.270 --> 13:43.550
(Later, I learned he secretly
harmed his own son, Xiao Huayong.)

13:43.840 --> 13:45.200
(But I dared not expose it.)

13:45.670 --> 13:48.150
(Though I sheltered
the young child from disaster,)

13:48.270 --> 13:50.960
(Tablet of Prince Qian, Xiao Juewei)
(I still cannot escape the blame.)

13:51.000 --> 13:53.030
(This is my second sin.)

13:53.344 --> 13:56.190
(Meng Weeps Blood and Kowtows)
(I received the ancestors' protection,)

13:56.200 --> 14:00.240
(yet I indulged my son in doing evil,
violating morality and heaven.)

14:00.550 --> 14:03.200
(Today, I bare my heart
with this edict of repentance,)

14:03.589 --> 14:05.139
(praying to the heavens)

14:05.220 --> 14:09.320
(Edict of Repentance)
(to bless Daxing with order and peace.)

14:09.480 --> 14:11.240
Back then, Father murdered Prince Qian.

14:11.630 --> 14:13.200
If this matter were exposed,

14:13.670 --> 14:14.720
the various factions

14:15.270 --> 14:16.630
would be unrestrained.

14:16.840 --> 14:19.750
Perhaps they would raise their
own armies and divide the empire.

14:19.910 --> 14:22.510
Grandmother either had
to join him in death,

14:23.510 --> 14:24.910
or cover for him

14:24.960 --> 14:26.784
to ensure his ascension to the throne.

14:26.960 --> 14:28.960
She had no choice at the time.

14:29.910 --> 14:31.000
Out of helplessness,

14:31.720 --> 14:33.670
Grandmother covered up
all of Father's sins.

14:34.480 --> 14:35.670
On this edict of repentance,

14:36.080 --> 14:38.000
every word is written
with a bleeding heart.

14:38.630 --> 14:40.080
It's written clearly.

14:41.670 --> 14:43.150
Even if you don't believe my words,

14:43.728 --> 14:44.910
you must know full well

14:45.480 --> 14:47.360
whether this handwriting is that

14:47.960 --> 14:49.600
of Grandmother herself.

14:52.790 --> 14:54.550
Why did Father want to kill me?

14:57.030 --> 14:59.440
Why bother racking your brains over it?

15:02.120 --> 15:03.390
I will let you go.

15:04.840 --> 15:06.150
You can ask him yourself.

15:07.270 --> 15:08.720
Wouldn't that be better?

15:12.200 --> 15:13.200
But sometimes,

15:14.000 --> 15:15.670
I truly don't understand.

15:16.360 --> 15:17.630
Why would a sickly person like me

15:17.630 --> 15:20.390
receive such generous treatment
and care from you?

15:21.240 --> 15:25.720
Whoever fed you the cherry cheese

15:26.240 --> 15:28.910
is the one who poisoned you.

15:29.440 --> 15:31.910
A word of advice for you.

15:32.390 --> 15:34.960
Don't put too much trust

15:35.750 --> 15:37.320
in your father.

15:37.910 --> 15:39.550
In his heart,

15:40.480 --> 15:42.150
there is only the throne.

15:43.080 --> 15:46.600
There is no father and son.

15:52.510 --> 16:04.150
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

16:04.150 --> 16:06.150
- Where are you, Crown Prince?
- Crown Prince!

16:06.150 --> 16:09.510
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

16:09.910 --> 16:10.720
Crown Princess,

16:11.080 --> 16:11.840
it's getting late,

16:11.840 --> 16:13.620
and the paths
are becoming harder to navigate.

16:13.632 --> 16:15.440
Let me have someone
escort you back first.

16:15.480 --> 16:16.360
We've got it from here.

16:16.440 --> 16:17.648
Until I find the Crown Prince,

16:17.904 --> 16:19.280
I absolutely will not go back.

16:19.440 --> 16:25.390
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

16:25.390 --> 16:26.000
Hurry!

16:27.030 --> 16:28.270
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

16:28.270 --> 16:28.840
Let's go!

16:29.030 --> 16:30.270
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

17:02.000 --> 17:04.070
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

17:04.070 --> 17:04.680
Crown Prince!

17:04.680 --> 17:05.900
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

17:05.920 --> 17:07.590
Crown Prince, where are you?

17:07.590 --> 17:11.510
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

17:13.310 --> 17:14.510
Slender-Leaf Qionghua.

17:16.070 --> 17:17.070
Moonlit Cool Fragrance.

17:17.070 --> 17:19.640
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

18:16.570 --> 18:21.950
♪As time rushes by,
spring brings life, autumn brings death♪

18:23.650 --> 18:29.440
♪A heart weathered by frost
will melt in love♪

18:30.460 --> 18:36.220
♪Across miles of treasured moments,
every move is a game of truth and lies♪

18:37.570 --> 18:43.360
♪With this broken body,
I'll become your armor♪

18:44.420 --> 18:50.030
♪I want destiny,
and also tender words of love♪

18:50.190 --> 18:57.780
♪As night stains my eyes,
I'll gaze once more at the rosy clouds♪

18:59.310 --> 19:00.000
Let's go.

19:01.310 --> 19:01.790
Mo Yuan.

19:01.990 --> 19:05.300
♪My heart rises and falls,
we embrace in a sea of clouds♪

19:05.469 --> 19:08.909
♪In this eternity, you are a part of it♪

19:08.990 --> 19:10.420
♪My longing can level♪

19:11.270 --> 19:12.310
Let me look at you.

19:12.830 --> 19:13.830
Are you hurt?

19:15.550 --> 19:16.350
I'm fine.

19:16.370 --> 19:18.710
♪Stars sink into my hair,
the moon slips through my fingers♪

19:18.720 --> 19:19.680
I'm perfectly fine.

19:20.830 --> 19:22.000
I'm not hurt at all.

19:22.940 --> 19:27.580
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

19:27.590 --> 19:29.160
Why did they let you go?

19:29.920 --> 19:33.300
♪I have a dream of a long wind
in my sleeves♪

19:33.300 --> 19:36.830
♪My heart rises and falls,
we embrace in a sea of clouds♪

19:36.970 --> 19:40.260
♪In this eternity, you are a part of it♪

19:40.380 --> 19:41.920
♪My longing can level♪

19:42.110 --> 19:43.750
Changtai let me out.

19:43.920 --> 19:46.750
♪Drunk or sober, it's all like a dream♪

19:46.790 --> 19:47.880
Let's go home first.

19:47.880 --> 19:50.910
♪Stars sink into my hair,
the moon slips through my fingers♪

19:50.910 --> 19:54.290
♪For how much joy
do we share this life together♪

19:54.290 --> 19:57.280
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

19:57.880 --> 19:58.510
Your Highness!

19:58.790 --> 19:59.440
Your Highness!

20:00.110 --> 20:00.920
Your Highness!

20:01.720 --> 20:02.720
Your Highness!

20:03.080 --> 20:05.190
♪May the sand and dirt in my sleeves♪

20:05.420 --> 20:07.980
♪Become the tears
in the corner of my eyes♪

20:08.880 --> 20:11.430
♪And blossom into a flower♪

20:15.980 --> 20:20.060
(Clarity and Serenity)

20:21.350 --> 20:22.110
Hurry up.

20:23.240 --> 20:23.920
Hurry.

20:28.070 --> 20:30.470
Your Majesty, Xiao Changtai has fled
into the deep mountains.

20:30.480 --> 20:32.704
We've lost his trail.
His whereabouts are unknown.

20:33.200 --> 20:34.350
Keep searching.

20:34.350 --> 20:35.312
Yes, Your Majesty.

20:41.510 --> 20:42.200
Your Majesty,

20:42.210 --> 20:44.300
the poison in the Crown Prince
has flared up again.

20:44.400 --> 20:45.350
It's very aggressive.

20:45.480 --> 20:47.000
Much more severe than before.

20:51.968 --> 20:53.552
- Your Majesty.
- Your Majesty.

20:53.880 --> 20:54.590
Your Majesty.

20:57.550 --> 20:58.240
Your Highness.

21:02.070 --> 21:02.720
Your Highness.

21:05.200 --> 21:05.920
Your Highness.

21:10.200 --> 21:11.110
Xihe.

21:11.400 --> 21:12.160
I'm here.

21:12.440 --> 21:13.240
I'm right here.

21:13.550 --> 21:14.440
Xihe.

21:19.750 --> 21:21.240
Huayong, come.

21:27.550 --> 21:28.110
What's wrong?

21:28.110 --> 21:29.000
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

21:29.000 --> 21:29.880
Call the imperial physician!

21:29.880 --> 21:30.640
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

21:32.680 --> 21:33.660
- Huayong.
- Call the imperial physician!

21:33.720 --> 21:34.810
- Huayong!
- Your Highness!

21:34.912 --> 21:36.496
- Huayong!
- Your Highness!

21:37.750 --> 21:38.680
Father.

21:40.480 --> 21:41.400
I don't believe it.

21:41.640 --> 21:42.510
Don't be afraid.

21:42.960 --> 21:43.920
It was just a dream.

22:17.790 --> 22:18.550
Your Highness,

22:19.440 --> 22:20.160
you're awake.

22:22.270 --> 22:23.440
Xihe,

22:24.256 --> 22:26.000
you've been with me this whole time?

23:01.640 --> 23:04.440
This is the medicine made
from the Slender-Leaf Qionghua?

23:09.790 --> 23:10.440
Your Highness,

23:11.880 --> 23:13.400
while I was watching over you,

23:14.200 --> 23:15.440
I kept thinking

23:16.400 --> 23:17.440
that when you woke up,

23:19.000 --> 23:20.960
there was something I must tell you.

23:21.240 --> 23:22.030
What is it?

23:22.880 --> 23:24.200
No matter the dangers ahead,

23:24.720 --> 23:25.720
I will stay by your side

23:26.400 --> 23:27.440
and press forward with you.

23:28.160 --> 23:29.110
In my heart,

23:29.920 --> 23:31.160
you are the best.

23:33.480 --> 23:34.440
With you here,

23:35.790 --> 23:37.350
my heart has found its home.

23:53.900 --> 23:56.700
(Chenning Hall)

24:03.750 --> 24:05.510
(Why did Father want to kill me?)

24:05.720 --> 24:08.160
Why bother racking your brains over it?

24:10.720 --> 24:12.030
I will let you go.

24:12.310 --> 24:13.640
(You can ask him yourself.)

24:14.200 --> 24:15.640
(Wouldn't that be better?)

24:23.830 --> 24:25.440
Your Majesty, time for your medicine.

24:30.310 --> 24:31.350
Greetings, Father.

24:36.550 --> 24:37.720
Huayong...

24:38.510 --> 24:40.400
My boy is back.

24:42.160 --> 24:42.830
Your Majesty.

24:43.920 --> 24:45.270
What's wrong with His Majesty?

24:46.030 --> 24:47.200
Your Highness,

24:47.400 --> 24:48.790
after you went missing,

24:48.790 --> 24:50.720
His Majesty worried day and night,

24:51.070 --> 24:52.750
and caught a cold.

24:54.000 --> 24:54.830
Come.

24:56.590 --> 24:57.550
Huayong,

24:57.960 --> 25:00.110
let me take a good look at you.

25:20.590 --> 25:22.030
Quick, tell me,

25:22.720 --> 25:24.350
how did you get back?

25:32.110 --> 25:33.310
I caught them off guard

25:34.270 --> 25:35.590
and escaped on my own.

25:37.350 --> 25:38.310
Good.

25:39.270 --> 25:40.400
That's good.

25:42.590 --> 25:44.350
Seeing my boy,

25:45.160 --> 25:45.880
my illness

25:47.270 --> 25:49.240
is more than half cured.

26:15.880 --> 26:17.030
Be good, Huayong.

26:17.830 --> 26:19.030
Drink your medicine.

26:20.590 --> 26:22.720
You'll slowly get better.

26:30.350 --> 26:30.880
Come.

28:30.750 --> 28:32.480
Father, it's broken.

28:34.000 --> 28:34.640
Come.

28:35.160 --> 28:36.200
Let me see.

28:38.510 --> 28:39.550
Let me take a look.

28:42.720 --> 28:43.510
It's cracked.

28:46.510 --> 28:48.310
As long as we repair it with care,

28:49.350 --> 28:51.000
it can be fixed.

29:11.270 --> 29:12.240
Father.

29:12.920 --> 29:13.720
You're awake.

29:21.720 --> 29:22.590
Huayong,

29:23.590 --> 29:25.350
I've fixed this box.

29:26.240 --> 29:27.750
From now on, use it

29:28.590 --> 29:30.400
to hold your favorite candies.

29:35.640 --> 29:36.920
Thank you, Father.

29:48.830 --> 29:50.000
This is what I

29:51.400 --> 29:52.590
used as a child.

29:54.510 --> 29:56.310
I can't believe you kept it
all this time.

30:00.640 --> 30:01.960
Inside are

30:04.310 --> 30:06.240
my favorite honey candies
from childhood.

30:28.920 --> 30:30.000
Huayong,

30:34.240 --> 30:35.790
you've suffered.

30:43.070 --> 30:45.400
Your body is still weak.

30:46.960 --> 30:48.750
Don't worry about me.

30:51.550 --> 30:53.680
Hurry back to your palace and rest.

30:55.720 --> 30:56.510
Get up.

31:05.550 --> 31:06.680
Go back.

31:07.200 --> 31:08.270
Let me help you lie down.

31:32.590 --> 31:33.590
I will take my leave.

33:30.640 --> 33:31.680
Let's go back.

33:49.460 --> 33:52.700
(East Palace)

34:14.928 --> 34:16.320
It's late and the dew is heavy.

34:16.624 --> 34:18.320
Why are you still out here in the wind?

34:20.070 --> 34:21.280
You haven't rested yet?

34:22.880 --> 34:24.000
I'm waiting for you.

34:33.070 --> 34:34.840
You went to see His Majesty today.

34:36.150 --> 34:38.360
Was it about
what the Fourth Prince said?

34:41.440 --> 34:43.400
He was desperate and talking nonsense.

34:43.920 --> 34:45.280
How could it be taken seriously?

34:45.550 --> 34:46.550
Father has ordered

34:46.592 --> 34:48.160
a strict manhunt across the country.

34:48.208 --> 34:49.150
Father and I

34:50.960 --> 34:52.230
have never had a rift.

34:53.440 --> 34:54.400
And we never will.

34:59.000 --> 35:01.360
If you want to be alone for a while,

35:02.880 --> 35:04.230
I'll go back and wait for you.

35:14.510 --> 35:15.630
Stay with me.

35:17.520 --> 35:18.630
Just for a little while.

35:21.000 --> 35:21.590
Okay.

35:22.640 --> 35:23.630
I'll stay with you.

35:25.230 --> 35:26.230
But...

35:27.590 --> 35:28.510
not here.

35:39.710 --> 35:40.550
Your Highness,

35:40.550 --> 35:41.960
the scented bath is ready.

35:42.360 --> 35:43.070
You may leave.

35:43.590 --> 35:44.150
Understood.

35:46.840 --> 35:47.480
Your Highness,

35:47.616 --> 35:49.030
go change your clothes first.

36:41.930 --> 36:44.600
♪Amidst the flickering lights♪

36:45.960 --> 36:48.670
♪Alone for several autumns♪

36:51.000 --> 36:53.110
This scented bath is indeed different.

36:53.400 --> 36:55.000
Just the smell of it is refreshing.

36:57.760 --> 36:58.920
In this bath,

36:59.030 --> 37:02.840
I used roselle, sour jujube seed,
and silktree bark.

37:03.280 --> 37:04.480
They are all herbs

37:05.320 --> 37:07.150
that calm the mind
and soothe the nerves.

37:07.560 --> 37:12.620
♪For all eternity♪

37:13.060 --> 37:15.710
♪The timeless wind and moon♪

37:16.290 --> 37:19.900
♪Quietly reflect in your sparkling eyes♪

37:21.070 --> 37:23.810
♪Scattered red petals fall like rain♪

37:24.270 --> 37:28.110
♪It's a wonderful time in the world♪

37:29.050 --> 37:31.890
♪Bits of worries and sorrows♪

37:32.280 --> 37:33.670
Is the water temperature okay?

37:37.440 --> 37:38.440
It's perfect.

37:40.670 --> 37:41.800
Are you still tired?

37:44.800 --> 37:45.630
With you here,

37:47.648 --> 37:48.710
everything is alright.

38:08.848 --> 38:10.190
Congratulations, Your Highness.

38:10.190 --> 38:11.880
The Crown Princess is pregnant.

38:12.320 --> 38:13.510
We're having a baby.

38:13.616 --> 38:15.470
(Three years old, four years old)
If there is truly a way

38:15.480 --> 38:17.230
(Fourteen years old)
to let me stay with her a little longer,

38:17.230 --> 38:18.992
even if it means enduring the agony
of reforging my body,

38:19.030 --> 38:20.000
I am willing to do it.

38:20.480 --> 38:21.710
Tell me the truth.

38:21.920 --> 38:24.320
Am I already beyond cure?

38:24.350 --> 38:29.490
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

38:31.510 --> 38:34.450
♪I've hidden so many words♪

38:35.070 --> 38:37.870
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

38:38.740 --> 38:45.710
♪So never uncover♪

38:45.900 --> 38:48.260
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

38:49.390 --> 38:52.120
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

38:53.080 --> 38:58.420
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

39:00.180 --> 39:03.000
♪Every answer I gave♪

39:03.800 --> 39:06.650
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

39:07.440 --> 39:10.810
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

39:11.070 --> 39:14.380
♪How hard it truly was?♪

39:17.350 --> 39:20.790
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

39:21.780 --> 39:24.110
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

39:25.380 --> 39:31.140
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

39:32.550 --> 39:35.680
♪It's a shame I never could♪

39:36.130 --> 39:39.140
♪Give you a moon in return♪

39:39.250 --> 39:45.890
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

39:45.890 --> 39:49.560
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

39:50.430 --> 39:53.190
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

39:53.630 --> 39:56.760
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

39:57.200 --> 40:03.150
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

40:04.550 --> 40:08.100
♪You'll never♪

40:08.380 --> 40:17.850
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

40:44.020 --> 40:47.500
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
